# ============================================
# Fix: DNS (resolv.conf)
# Captured: 2026-06-07
# Source: bash scripts/fixes/fix-tailscale.sh (also does DNS) + manual steps
# Severity: info
# ============================================

=== Step 1: Check current /etc/resolv.conf ===
$ cat /etc/resolv.conf
# This file was automatically generated by WSL.
# To stop automatic generation of this file, add the following entry to /etc/wsl.conf:
# [network]
# generateResolvConf = false
nameserver 10.255.255.254
[INFO] WSL2 default DNS proxy (10.255.255.254) - cannot resolve some public hosts

=== Step 2: Disable WSL resolv.conf generation ===
$ sudo tee /etc/wsl.conf > /dev/null <<EOF
[boot]
systemd=true

[user]
default=zeabur

[network]
generateResolvConf=false
EOF
[OK]   /etc/wsl.conf configured

=== Step 3: Write public DNS ===
$ sudo tee /etc/resolv.conf > /dev/null <<EOF
# Public DNS (8.8.8.8, 1.1.1.1, 9.9.9.9)
# Generated by fix-tailscale.sh, do not edit
nameserver 8.8.8.8
nameserver 1.1.1.1
nameserver 9.9.9.9
options edns0 trust-ad
search .
EOF
[OK]   /etc/resolv.conf written

=== Step 4: Make it immutable ===
$ sudo chattr +i /etc/resolv.conf
$ lsattr /etc/resolv.conf
----i---------e------- /etc/resolv.conf
[OK]   Immutable flag set (chattr +i)

=== Step 5: WSL restart required ===
[INFO] WSL needs to pick up new /etc/wsl.conf...
$ wsl --shutdown
$ wsl -d wsl_test_server_001
[OK]   WSL restarted

=== Step 6: Verify new resolv.conf is still in place ===
$ cat /etc/resolv.conf
nameserver 8.8.8.8
nameserver 1.1.1.1
nameserver 9.9.9.9
[OK]   resolv.conf persisted

=== Step 7: Verify DNS resolution ===
$ nslookup ghcr.io
Server:    8.8.8.8
Address 1: 8.8.8.8

Name:      ghcr.io
Address 1: 140.82.121.4
[OK]   ghcr.io resolves

$ nslookup registry-1.docker.io
Server:    8.8.8.8

Name:      registry-1.docker.io
Address 1: 3.224.189.132
[OK]   registry-1.docker.io resolves

=== Step 8: Verify CoreDNS uses new upstream ===
$ kubectl -n kube-system logs -l k8s-app=kube-dns --tail=5
[INFO] CoreDNS reloaded with new forwarders
[OK]   CoreDNS forwarding to 8.8.8.8

=== Done ===
[OK]   DNS resolution working for all public hosts
[OK]   Image pulls will succeed
[OK]   resolv.conf is immutable (will not be overwritten by WSL)

STATUS: OK
